<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76440" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰγίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ʽπήγνυμἰ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάγη</span>
			, <i>trap</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Batr.
				117
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				458
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.109
			</span></i> (Antip.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παγίδας ἱστάναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					527
				</span></i>
			 (anap.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				194
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>trap, snare</i>, of women, <i><span class="en">
				Amphis
				23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				689
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δουρατέα π.</span>, of the Trojan
			horse, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.152
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἄρτοις . . ἱστᾶσι
			παγίδας</span> they try to 'raise the wind', <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				66
			</span></i>; of women's ornaments, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				666
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγκυρα νεῶν π.</span> the anchor
				<i>which holds</i> ships <i>fast,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				6.5
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
